Now — the Java side: NavigationContainer must emit the depth. Let me look at the Java NavigationContainer and Router to add depth emission. The Router has a back-stack; depth = back-stack size + 1 (or size?). Let me check the Java code.

Let me also define the property ID. ROUTE = 0x2019. Next free in that range: 0x201A. Call it `NAV_DEPTH` (U32). value_type U32. Add to constants.rs value_type_for.

