if (height != null) props.add(Modified.prop(Properties.HEIGHT, height));
if (alignment != null) props.add(Modified.prop(Properties.ALIGNMENT, alignment));
return Modified.props(content, props.toArray(...));
```

This also makes the original 3-arg overload work identically (all non-null). Let me implement.

